Subject: [PATCH] thermal: rcar_thermal: convert to SPDX identifiers
MIME-Version: 1.0 (generated by SEMI-EPG 1.14.7 - "Harue")
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=US-ASCII
Date: Mon, 30 Jul 2018 07:56:06 +0000
